  "problem": "$\\int \\operatorname{sech}\u2061y(5\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y)\\text{d}y=$",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y)=-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y & \\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y=-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y)={sech}^{2}\u2061y & \\,\u21d2\\,\\int {sech}^{2}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y=\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sech}\u2061y(5\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y)\\text{d}y & =\\int (5\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y-{sech}^{2}\u2061y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =5\\int \\operatorname{sech}\u2061y\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y-\\int {sech}^{2}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-5\\operatorname{sech}\u2061y-\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
